  "description": "FoMo-Net is a pretraining framework for remote sensing foundation models, designed to process any combination of commonly used modalities and spectral bands in remote sensing. It is trained on a diverse set of satellite and aerial datasets and evaluated on the FoMo-Bench benchmark for forest monitoring tasks.",
